Research / portfolio project — for non-commercial academic use.

Original analysis code, documentation, and demo. Builds on the LibEER
framework (https://github.com/XJTU-EEG/LibEER) and the SEED dataset
(BCMI Lab, Shanghai Jiao Tong University).

The SEED dataset is subject to its own license (academic, non-commercial);
users must request access from BCMI Lab directly. No SEED data is included here.
